.TH devin-doctor 1  "doctor " 
.SH NAME
devin\-doctor \- Diagnose the local Devin configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin doctor\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
